&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn enterprise ambition into measurable impact with AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if your next enterprise deal could transform how a leading organization in the DACH market connects with its customers? As a Senior Enterprise Account Executive on Coveo’s EMEA team, you’ll bring our AI-powered solutions to enterprise organizations across Germany, Austria and Switzerland, turning ambitious business priorities into measurable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own complex enterprise sales cycles from prospecting through close, combining your knowledge of the DACH market, consultative selling skills and a strong partner ecosystem to build trusted relationships and create long-term customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As one of our Senior Enterprise Account Executives, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute strategic account plans for enterprise organizations across the DACH market, identifying opportunities where Coveo can deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop trusted relationships with key decision-makers and senior executives, navigating complex organizations to create new opportunities and lasting partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate and develop your own pipeline while partnering with Coveo’s alliances team and broader partner ecosystem to uncover and accelerate opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling business proposals that connect Coveo’s artificial intelligence capabilities to each customer’s priorities, challenges and potential business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage complex enterprise sales cycles end to end, assessing stakeholders, resources, timing, probability of closure and financial impact while maintaining accurate visibility into sales activity and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead opportunities through negotiation and close, securing agreements and consistently working toward quarterly and annual sales quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here is what will qualify you for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing complex enterprise software sales cycles in the DACH market, engaging stakeholders from business champions through senior executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in German and English, with the ability to build trusted relationships, lead business conversations and negotiate effectively in both languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of generating your own enterprise opportunities and meeting or exceeding sales quotas in a results-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative and challenger-oriented sales approach, with the curiosity and discipline to understand sophisticated technology and translate it into clear customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will make you stand out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling enterprise artificial intelligence, generative artificial intelligence or other sophisticated technology solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MEDDPICC certification or demonstrated experience applying the methodology to complex enterprise sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An established understanding of the DACH enterprise landscape and experience developing opportunities alongside strategic technology or consulting partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A humble, curious and creative mindset, paired with the drive to build trusted customer relationships across different organizations and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you think you can bring this role to life? Send us your application, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Salary:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;100,000 EUR to 120,000 EUR&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that the amount of the offer will depend on the candidate’s previous experience and skillset.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Coveolife!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage all qualified candidates to apply regardless of, for example, age, gender, disability, gaps in CV, national or ethnic background.&lt;/p&gt;
