&lt;div&gt;Consulting experience, ideally in strategy consulting, combined with experience at a system integrator or delivery firm.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Track record of managing projects and leading teams, including development teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience presenting to C-level stakeholders and running workshops independently.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Technical and functional skills:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;GenAI architectures: RAG, agentic and multi-agent patterns, LLMOps, model evaluation, guardrails and responsible AI.&lt;/div&gt;
