&lt;p&gt;As a Lead/Principal Journey Architect on GitLab&#39;s Digital Customer Outcomes team, you&#39;ll connect programs into customer journeys that drive meaningful actions, retention, consumption and revenue outcomes. You&#39;ll own journey design and service blueprints, starting with priority cohorts and expanding across products, personas and named, pooled and digital coverage models. Reporting to the Vice President, Digital Customer Outcomes, you&#39;ll join as an individual contributor at L5 (Lead/Staff) or L6 (Principal), depending on your experience and scope. At L5, you&#39;ll lead journey design and builds for priority cohorts; at L6, you&#39;ll own the journey framework across all products, personas and coverage models with division-wide influence. Digital Orchestration builds and runs journeys day to day; you&#39;ll remain accountable for their outcomes and improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
